    "description": "Tsurumi Manufacturing Co.,Ltd. produces, purchases, imports, exports, sells, and leases submersible pumps, environmental and peripheral equipment, and other pumps worldwide. The company provides water pumps, including portable dewatering, dewatering, slurry, portable residue dewatering, corrosion-resistant, seawater-resistant dewatering, explosion-proof dewatering, pumps for high temperature liquids and sewage bypass, engine-driven dewatering, self-priming residue dewatering, cast iron, resin-made, seawater-resistant sewage, stainless steel, cast stainless steel, titanium, submersible axial flow, submersible mixed flow, domestic pumps, vertical multistage in-line, and horizontal multistage. It also offers water treatment equipment, including aeration equipment, scum skimmers, decanters, screening equipment, and dehydrators; liquid ring pumps; liquid level sensors; and generators. Its products are used in construction and mining, civil engineering, industry and energy, agriculture and irrigation, river and flood control, waterworks and wastewater, and environmental protection fields. Tsurumi Manufacturing Co.,Ltd. was founded in 1924 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan."
